OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785212281
OL,3,CCold case squad 'haunted' by unsolved
OL,4,Cdisappearance of Suzy Lamplugh
OL,6,FCold case detectives remain "haunted"
OL,7,Fby the unsolved disappearance of Suzy
OL,8,FLamplugh 40 years on, as the clock
OL,9,Fticks down to the case being
OL,10,Fmothballed in 12 months' time.
OL,12,FThe 25-year-old estate agent left the
OL,13,Foffice of Sturgis and Sons in Fulham,
OL,14,Fwest London, at 12.30pm on July 28
OL,15,F1986 and never returned.
OL,26,@nD@]OUnD@eO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
