PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785212281
OL,3,CCold case squad 'haunted' by unsolved
OL,4,Cdisappearance of Suzy Lamplugh
OL,6,FHead of the Metropolitan Police cold
OL,7,Fcase homicide squad Detective Chief
OL,8,FInspector Teresa Foster said four
OL,9,Fdecades on and with the prime suspect
OL,10,Fin the case dead, her team's wish
OL,11,Fremains to "bring Suzy home".
OL,13,FMiss Lamplugh put an appointment with
OL,14,Fa mysterious "Mr Kipper" at a property
OL,15,Fin Shorrolds Road, Fulham, in her work
OL,16,Fdiary on the day she vanished.
OL,18,FHer company car, a white Ford Fiesta,
OL,19,Fwas later found abandoned in nearby
OL,20,FStevenage Road. She was legally
OL,21,Fdeclared presumed dead in 1993.
OL,26,@sD@LOUsD@\O]vD@NOUvD@XO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785212281
OL,3,CCold case squad 'haunted' by unsolved
OL,4,Cdisappearance of Suzy Lamplugh
OL,6,FMs Foster said: "It haunts myself as
OL,7,Fthe senior investigating officer, and
OL,8,FI think that comes down to the fact
OL,9,Fthat Suzy's never been found.
OL,11,F"With a lot of our cases we do have an
OL,12,Fanswer for the family, we know where
OL,13,Fthey were, we know what happened to
OL,14,Fthem.
OL,16,F"But with this, Suzy never being
OL,17,Ffound, and it haunts us. We don't have
OL,18,Fa case like this within my team."
OL,26,@nD@QOUsD@AOUxD@AOUzD@aO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/13
