OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785212281
OL,3,CCold case squad 'haunted' by unsolved
OL,4,Cdisappearance of Suzy Lamplugh
OL,6,FMiss Lamplugh's disappearance sparked
OL,7,Fone of the largest ever missing
OL,8,Fpersons investigations in the UK.
OL,10,FThe inquiry is the only Metropolitan
OL,11,FPolice case that still uses the old
OL,12,F1980s card index system in case any
OL,13,Fcrucial piece of written information
OL,14,Ffrom the time has been overlooked.
OL,16,FThe force is set to move the inquiry
OL,17,Fto an "inactive phase" in 12 months'
OL,18,Ftime, meaning that while new
OL,19,Finformation will be followed up, the
OL,20,Fteam will no longer actively work on
OL,21,Fthe case.
OL,26,@yD@GOUyD@VO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
