PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785212281
OL,3,CCold case squad 'haunted' by unsolved
OL,4,Cdisappearance of Suzy Lamplugh
OL,6,FJohn Cannan, the prime suspect, died
OL,7,Fin prison in November 2024, while
OL,8,Fserving a jail sentence for the 1987
OL,9,Fabduction and murder of Bristol
OL,10,Fnewlywed Shirley Banks.
OL,12,FPolice presented a file of evidence to
OL,13,Fprosecutors in 2002 but there was not
OL,14,Fenough to charge him with Suzy's
OL,15,Fmurder, and no forensic evidence has
OL,16,Fever been found to link him to her
OL,17,Fdisappearance.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785212281
OL,3,CCold case squad 'haunted' by unsolved
OL,4,Cdisappearance of Suzy Lamplugh
OL,6,FEvidence gathered from the headrest of
OL,7,Fa seat in her car using adhesive tape
OL,8,Fhas been analysed for mitochondrial
OL,9,FDNA in the US, but no profile could be
OL,10,Ffound.
OL,12,FA smudged fingerprint was also found
OL,13,Fon the rear view mirror of the car,
OL,14,Fbut investigators have never found out
OL,15,Fwho it belongs to.
OL,17,FMs Foster said breakthroughs in AI or
OL,18,Fforensics could hold the key to
OL,19,Fcracking the case in the future, or if
OL,20,Fpeople with information decide to come
OL,21,Fforward.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
