OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785212281
OL,3,CCold case squad 'haunted' by unsolved
OL,4,Cdisappearance of Suzy Lamplugh
OL,6,FShe remembers when Suzy first
OL,7,Fdisappeared in 1986 ` the story even
OL,8,Fmade the news in her small home town
OL,9,Fin New Zealand.
OL,11,F"Bringing somebody to justice is
OL,12,Falways going to be difficult when it's
OL,13,F40 years (on).
OL,15,F"We will rely on forensics, but for
OL,16,Fus, the most important thing is
OL,17,Ffinding Suzy and bringing Suzy home.
OL,19,F"I'm quite excited about what's
OL,20,Fhappening in the artificial
OL,21,Fintelligence world.
OL,26,@sD@AOUwD@AOU{D@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/13
