PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785212281
OL,3,CCold case squad 'haunted' by unsolved
OL,4,Cdisappearance of Suzy Lamplugh
OL,6,F"It could change any murder
OL,7,Finvestigation, but most especially a
OL,8,Fcold case with all the documents that
OL,9,Fwe have.
OL,11,F"But also change of allegiance, family
OL,12,Fmembers coming forward, even after 40
OL,13,Fyears.
OL,15,F"We've seen this recently with two
OL,16,Fcases that the Met has prosecuted, and
OL,17,Fit's family members coming forward,
OL,18,Fjust giving us the information that we
OL,19,Fneed."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUwD@AOU{D@FO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/13
