OL,3,CCold case squad 'haunted' by unsolved
OL,4,Cdisappearance of Suzy Lamplugh
OL,6,FThree killers were brought to justice
OL,7,Fin two cases where family members
OL,8,Fpassed on information after decades `
OL,9,FJanice Nix, and brothers Michael and
OL,10,FAnthony Stewart.
OL,12,FNix was convicted in June of the 1978
OL,13,Fmanslaughter of her five-year-old
OL,14,Fstepdaughter Andrea Bernard by forcing
OL,15,Fher into a scalding bath; and the
OL,16,FStewarts were jailed in the same month
OL,17,Ffor the 1984 murder of civil servant
OL,18,FAnthony Littler.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
