PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785212281
OL,3,CCold case squad 'haunted' by unsolved
OL,4,Cdisappearance of Suzy Lamplugh
OL,6,FOne informant previously claimed
OL,7,Fpolice had not taken him seriously
OL,8,Fwhen he reported seeing a man throwing
OL,9,Fsomething in the Grand Union Canal at
OL,10,Fthe time of Suzy's disappearance.
OL,12,FBut the cold case team is confident
OL,13,Fthat the correct stretch of water was
OL,14,Ffully searched in 2014 during a
OL,15,Fseparate inquiry, the case of murdered
OL,16,Fteenager Alice Gross, and nothing
OL,17,Frelating to Miss Lamplugh's
OL,18,Fdisappearance was found.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
