OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785212281
OL,3,CCold case squad 'haunted' by unsolved
OL,4,Cdisappearance of Suzy Lamplugh
OL,6,FA number of searches have previously
OL,7,Fbeen carried out in relation to the
OL,8,Fcase, including on land between
OL,9,FPershore and Drakes Broughton in
OL,10,FWorcestershire in 2010; in a property
OL,11,Fin Sutton Coldfield, West Midlands, in
OL,12,F2018; and on land near Drakes
OL,13,FBroughton in Worcestershire in 2019,
OL,14,Fbut nothing was found.
OL,16,FMiss Lamplugh's parents set up the
OL,17,FSuzy Lamplugh Trust in the wake of her
OL,18,Fdisappearance to champion women's
OL,19,Fsafety.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
