OL,3,CCold case squad 'haunted' by unsolved
OL,4,Cdisappearance of Suzy Lamplugh
OL,6,FThe family has released previously
OL,7,Funpublished photos of her to mark the
OL,8,F40th anniversary.
OL,10,FIn a statement issued through the
OL,11,Fcharity, her siblings Lizzie, Tamsin
OL,12,Fand Richard said: "She was, as she is
OL,13,Falways portrayed, a truly beautiful
OL,14,Fperson inside and out.
OL,16,F"Everyone who met Suz (correct) was
OL,17,Ftouched by her kindness, empathy,
OL,18,Fstrength of character and joy for life.
OL,26,@tD@SOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/13
